{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PSI is a movement-based first-person roguelite climbing game.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/ad88f28281c98ac287e924d70dddbbde.poster.avif?t=1767469989\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/ad88f28281c98ac287e924d70dddbbde.webm?t=1767469989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/ad88f28281c98ac287e924d70dddbbde.mp4?t=1767469989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cargo cult of amphibians is on its final leg of existence, as a famine has struck their crops...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/692a0d0c6a8573a19214b49f092f2d36.poster.avif?t=1767469989\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/692a0d0c6a8573a19214b49f092f2d36.webm?t=1767469989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/692a0d0c6a8573a19214b49f092f2d36.mp4?t=1767469989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They only have one month before STARVATION. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your jetpack made by hand, you must climb to the top of their industrial cosmos to convene with your god to restore water to the village.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Loot Caves!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/a69970798b54a221795821295db4ce6c.poster.avif?t=1767469989\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/a69970798b54a221795821295db4ce6c.webm?t=1767469989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/a69970798b54a221795821295db4ce6c.mp4?t=1767469989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of loot caves, each with its own obstacles and puzzles. Choose what to take wisely, you have a limited inventory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Life Counts!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/98716da11392b01f33d1b8923d4c8d0a.poster.avif?t=1767469989\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/98716da11392b01f33d1b8923d4c8d0a.webm?t=1767469989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/98716da11392b01f33d1b8923d4c8d0a.mp4?t=1767469989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a scarce amount of climbers, once you run out, the game restarts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/9248b6308d65dbbdead4a1d93e4d2905.poster.avif?t=1767469989\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/9248b6308d65dbbdead4a1d93e4d2905.webm?t=1767469989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/9248b6308d65dbbdead4a1d93e4d2905.mp4?t=1767469989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock to discover what world lays beyond your industrial cosmos. It's your peoples only hope...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpack Boost Mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic World Based Crosshair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diegetic UI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-Linear Level Design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2386200?t=1767469989","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2386200?t=1767469989","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/01798b0f35d7f779076ced24f1fd3ab00516504a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767469989","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/01798b0f35d7f779076ced24f1fd3ab00516504a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767469989","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join The Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/c4e3ea9f1e948663a1ee65004a453b7b.avif?t=1767469989\" width=1560 height=538 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PSI is a movement-based first-person roguelite climbing game.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/ad88f28281c98ac287e924d70dddbbde.poster.avif?t=1767469989\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/ad88f28281c98ac287e924d70dddbbde.webm?t=1767469989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/ad88f28281c98ac287e924d70dddbbde.mp4?t=1767469989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cargo cult of amphibians is on its final leg of existence, as a famine has struck their crops...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/692a0d0c6a8573a19214b49f092f2d36.poster.avif?t=1767469989\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/692a0d0c6a8573a19214b49f092f2d36.webm?t=1767469989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/692a0d0c6a8573a19214b49f092f2d36.mp4?t=1767469989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They only have one month before STARVATION. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your jetpack made by hand, you must climb to the top of their industrial cosmos to convene with your god to restore water to the village.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Loot Caves!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/a69970798b54a221795821295db4ce6c.poster.avif?t=1767469989\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s